        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="sp-daily__benefit-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'package' %}</span>
          <h3>Keeps things organized</h3>
          <p>A clear kit format makes the puja space simpler to maintain and easier to restock over time.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="sp-daily__benefit-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'home' %}</span>
          <h3>Made for home worship</h3>
          <p>A practical everyday assortment for regular prayer, aarti and your family’s customary devotional routine.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="sp-daily__benefit-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'gift' %}</span>
          <h3>Easy to gift</h3>
          <p>A thoughtful, useful devotional gift for parents, elders, newly set-up homes and loved ones.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-daily__story">
      <div class="sp-daily__story-copy">
        <p class="sp-daily__eyebrow">Prepared with care</p>
        <h2>See the details before it reaches your mandir.</h2>
        <p>Clear jars, labeled essentials and a neat presentation make it easier to understand what you have and reach for what you need.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Easy-to-recognize everyday essentials</li>
          <li>Neat, compact presentation</li>
          <li>Built around repeat home-puja use</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="sp-daily__story-media">
        <img
          src="{{ 'sabpuja-daily-puja-kit-detail.webp' | asset_url }}"
          alt="Close-up of Sabpuja Daily Puja Kit packaging and puja essentials"
          width="1254"
          height="1254"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-daily__how">
