        <p class="sp-daily__eyebrow">How it fits into your day</p>
        <h2>A simple three-step daily routine.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol>
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Keep it near your home mandir</strong><p>Store the kit together so the basics are ready when it is time for puja.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>Use what your tradition calls for</strong><p>Select the relevant samagri for your family’s regular prayer or aarti practice.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>Replenish as needed</strong><p>Continue your routine and replace consumable items as they are used.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-daily__lifestyle">
      <div class="sp-daily__lifestyle-media">
        <img
          src="{{ 'sabpuja-daily-puja-kit-lifestyle.webp' | asset_url }}"
          alt="Sabpuja Daily Puja Kit being used in a calm home puja setting"
          width="1448"
          height="1086"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async">
      </div>
      <div class="sp-daily__lifestyle-copy">
        <p class="sp-daily__eyebrow">For the everyday moments</p>
        <h2>Prepared to feel at home in your puja space.</h2>
        <p>The Daily Puja Kit is designed around practical everyday worship—not complicated instructions. Follow your customary family practice or priest guidance where appropriate.</p>
        <a class="sp-daily__text-link" href="#daily-puja-buy">Choose your quantity <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-daily__reviews" aria-labelledby="daily-reviews-title">
      <div class="sp-daily__section-head sp-daily__reviews-head">
        <div>
          <p class="sp-daily__eyebrow">Sabpuja customer stories</p>
          <h2 id="daily-reviews-title">What customers are saying.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="sp-daily__review-controls">
          <button type="button" data-daily-review-prev aria-label="Previous review">←</button>
          <button type="button" data-daily-review-next aria-label="Next review">→</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sp-daily__review-track" data-daily-review-track tabindex="0">
        {% for review_number in sp_reviews %}
          {% capture review_asset %}sabpuja-customer-review-{{ review_number }}.webp{% endcapture %}
          <article class="sp-daily__review-card">
            <img
              src="{{ review_asset | asset_url }}"
              alt="Sabpuja customer review card {{ forloop.index }} of 6"
